{"agent_id":"pp3g-kbb0-implement-135-phase-2-wire-heartbeat-into-opencode-s","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-06T05:34:14.403209231Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"d549549c-e14f-4d9e-97b2-3c0888ddf035","comment_uuid":"4a9f0059-8784-46a2-88d9-ae18e84ae73b","author":"pp3g-kbb0-implement-135-phase-2-wire-heartbeat-into-opencode-s","content":"Plan: implement heartbeat under opencode via a native plugin.\n\n(1) PLUGIN — new .opencode/plugins/heartbeat-guard.ts (sibling of crosslink-guard.ts/rtk-guard.ts). Hook = 'tool.execute.after' — verified in @opencode-ai/plugin 1.18.13 API surface: it fires per tool call (direct analog of Claude Code PostToolUse that heartbeat.py used); 'session.idle' exists only as an SDK Event fired at turn boundaries, NOT during active agent work, so tool.execute.after is the correct pick. Behavior mirrors heartbeat.py: walk up from cwd to an initialized .crosslink (hook-config.json present), gate on agent.json (agent context), throttle 120s via stamp mtime, write .crosslink/.cache/last-heartbeat with epoch content. Fail-open: never throws/blocks; logs to /tmp/heartbeat-guard.log.\n\n(2) REGISTRATION — add './plugins/heartbeat-guard.ts' to .opencode/opencode.json plugin array. Verified fork launch.rs: kickoff worktrees carry .opencode/ from the branch; init_worktree_agent/ensure_worktree_hooks only touch .claude/hooks/*.py, never .opencode/ — so committing plugin+registration to the branch is how 'opencode run' agents get it (same path crosslink-guard/rtk-guard use).\n\n(3) VERIFY — (a) local: fresh headless 'opencode run' in this worktree → heartbeat file appears + mtime advances; (b) live kickoff: create verification worktree FROM this feature branch (plugin not yet on main), kickoff --branch, watch heartbeat flow; (c) tools/kickoff-notify.py --once --dry-run sees the heartbeat.\n\n(4) DOCS — .crosslink/knowledge/agent-orchestration-playbook.md §6.4 + tools/kickoff-notify.py docstring: heartbeat now flows under opencode via plugin; keep .claude hook for Claude Code sessions. Coordinate with #146: this detection tier is what its kill/restart gates depend on.\n\n(5) Do NOT modify crosslink fork source. Commit with [#135] ref.","created_at":"2026-08-06T05:34:14.389355061Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:wSvyd4V7/riJNxfBbw93cLuINYBu/RT9lrcMDFI+5VQ","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgO490cE2pfgAsiN6Ixl/hApF12wP4Z95BVz6GkYxdMRUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA5hMJs2Kt2yMAve+Ym7JLl/fZjEwooR78+sVNsPPmw40BJicoq5cWEekU8h1BlX5zBEomFQmw7LMRjCBt67ZQDg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:wSvyd4V7/riJNxfBbw93cLuINYBu/RT9lrcMDFI+5VQ","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgO490cE2pfgAsiN6Ixl/hApF12wP4Z95BVz6GkYxdMRUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPgRd1HOcMckptcX6V0BmwT6bMM8TezsN8XHIh8GrEl7z13kWx7uEw7pORE71GRIalqqBTbotFLt07/8yShyDwc="}
